# Files that live in the repo but must never be served publicly.
# Format is the same as .gitignore. This file sits in the root of the assets
# directory (which here is the repo root).

# ── Repo internals ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .git MUST stay listed: the assets directory is the repo root, so without
# this the entire history — including .git/config — would be downloadable.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
# local state written by `wrangler dev`
.wrangler
.wrangler/**

# ── Project documentation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
README.md
DESIGN.md
PRODUCT.md
.impeccable
.impeccable/**

# ── Design source files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Already converted into gentec2026/assets/ (SVG + PNG); the originals are
# kept in the repo for future edits but are not for public download.
Sello-50-aniversario.ai
Ligas para el linktree.docx
Emprendimiento-logo.jpeg
Exatec-logo.jpg
other-logo.png
